# SPOKEDU public website

Full contract: [docs/SPOKEDU_PUBLIC_WEBSITE_SSOT.md](docs/SPOKEDU_PUBLIC_WEBSITE_SSOT.md)

## Do

- One brand journey, not per-page decoration.
- Two purchase axes only: 체육교육 (`/education`) and 구독시스템 (`/subscription` → MASTER). SPOMOVE = content/IP. SPOMAT = execution tool.
- Header: 체육교육 → 구독시스템 → SPOMOVE → 운영 사례 + `[상담하기]`. Do not add About / SPOMAT / Partners / 개인·소그룹.
- Institution canonical: `/education`. Do **not** redirect `/info/dispatch` or `/info/dispatch.html` to `/education`. Those URLs stay as the legacy dispatch page.
- `/subscription` sells and hands off to MASTER. No public `/product` → `/purchase` funnel.
- Korean display = keep-all + strict + balance. Body = keep-all + strict + pretty. Never split words to keep a grid.
- CTA grammar and motion tokens match Home. Hover only `@media (hover:hover) and (pointer:fine)`.
- Unverified counts, conversion rates, causal “향상/치료” claims: forbidden.
- Page-by-page: READ → contract check → implement → visual QA → PO review → LOCK. Then next page.

## Do not

- Touch MASTER while doing public work.
- Redesign Education structure away from legacy `/info/dispatch` without PO.
- Commit, push, branch, reset, restore, revert unless the user names that action.
- Change unrelated working-tree files.
